#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"1. <strong>Create a purchase order:</strong>\n"
"                    Select the materials you need for your breads and "
"pastries."
msgstr ""
"1. <strong>ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້:</strong>\n"
"                    ເລືອກວັດຖຸດິບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການສຳລັບເຂົ້າຈີ່ ແລະ ເຂົ້າໜົມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid "1. Configure Products and Their Display"
msgstr "1. ກຳນົດຄ່າສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ການສະແດງຜົນຂອງສິນຄ້າ"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"2. <strong>Choose the best vendor:</strong>\n"
"                    Pick the vendor offering the best deal for the requested "
"materials."
msgstr ""
"2. <strong>ເລືອກຜູ້ສະໜອງທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ:</strong>\n"
"                    ເລືອກຜູ້ສະໜອງທີ່ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດສຳລັບວັດຖຸດິບທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid "2. Review General E-commerce Policies"
msgstr "2. ກວດກາຄືນນະໂຍບາຍອີຄອມເມີຊທົ່ວໄປ"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid "3. Set Up Payment and Delivery"
msgstr "3. ຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊຳລະເງິນ ແລະ ການຈັດສົ່ງ"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Use the</b>"
msgstr "<b>ນຳໃຊ້</b>"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.homepage
msgid ""
"<br/>At our bakery, every creation is made with love, using only the finest "
"natural ingredients, to deliver treats that are as wholesome as they are "
"delicious—bringing warmth and happiness to your table with every bite.<br/"
"><br/>"
msgstr ""
"<br/>ຢູ່ຮ້ານເບເກີຣີຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ທຸກໆເມນູຖືກສ້າງສັນຂຶ້ນມາດ້ວຍຄວາມຮັກ ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ສະເພາະວັດຖຸດິບທຳມະຊາດ"
"ທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ເພື່ອມອບຄວາມແຊບຊ້ອຍ ແລະ ດີຕໍ່ສຸຂະພາບ—ພ້ອມທັງສົ່ງມອບຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ຄວາມສຸກສູ່ໂຕະອາຫານຂອງ"
"ທ່ານໃນທຸກໆຄຳ.<br/><br/>"

