#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting:</strong>\n"
"                    Automatically log payments, close sessions, and generate "
"tax reports."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ:</strong>\n"
"                    ບັນທຶກການຊຳລະເງິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ປິດຮອບການຂາຍ ແລະ ສ້າງລາຍງານພາສີ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automatic Delivery:</strong>\n"
"                    Once the quote is accepted, it's possible to deliver the "
"products just as it does for a regular e-commerce order."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດສົ່ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ:</strong>\n"
"                    ເມື່ອໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຖືກຍອມຮັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າໄດ້ຄືກັນກັບລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້"
"ອີຄອມເມີຊທົ່ວໄປ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Crucial Review:</strong>\n"
"                    You must review all e-commerce settings to ensure they "
"align with your\n"
"                    internal business policies (e.g., when invoices are "
"generated, whether a\n"
"                    mandatory customer check-in is required for ordering, "
"etc.)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການກວດກາທີ່ສຳຄັນ:</strong>\n"
"                    ທ່ານຕ້ອງກວດກາຄືນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີຄອມເມີຊທັງໝົດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນສອດຄ່ອງກັບ\n"
"                    ນະໂຍບາຍທຸລະກິດພາຍໃນຂອງທ່ານ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: ເວລາໃດທີ່ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ,\n"
"                    ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າລົງທະບຽນກ່ອນສັ່ງຊື້ຫຼືບໍ່, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Define B2B Pricing:</strong>\n"
"                    Create and assign a dedicated pricelist to each B2B "
"contact. Ensure this pricelist\n"
"                    is active on your website so the customer sees their "
"agreed-upon prices upon login."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ກຳນົດລາຄາ B2B:</strong>\n"
"                    ສ້າງ ແລະ ກຳນົດລາຍການລາຄາສະເພາະໃຫ້ແກ່ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ B2B ແຕ່ລະລາຍ. ກວດເບິ່ງໃ"
"ຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າລາຍການລາຄານີ້\n"
"                    ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າເຫັນລາຄາທີ່ໄດ້ຕົກລົງກັນໄວ້ເມື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່"
"ລະບົບ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Delivery Methods:</strong>\n"
"                    Go to <strong>Website &gt; Configuration &gt; Delivery "
"Methods</strong>\n"
"                    to define all available options and their costs."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ວິທີການຈັດສົ່ງ:</strong>\n"
"                    ໄປທີ່ <strong>ເວັບໄຊ &gt; ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ &gt; ວິທີການຈັດສົ່ງ</strong>\n"
"                    ເພື່ອກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ ແລະ ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍຂອງແຕ່ລະວິທີ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>E-commerce Category:</strong> For easier product retrieval by "
"customers on your online store."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໝວດໝູ່ອີຄອມເມີຊ:</strong> ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຄົ້ນຫາສິນຄ້າໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນໃນຮ້ານຄ້າອອນລາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Employee Scheduling:</strong>\n"
"                    Use the <strong>Planning App</strong> to create and "
"manage employee schedules,\n"
"                    ensuring you have the right staff at the right times for "
"busy days and specific orders."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດຕາຕະລາງພະນັກງານ:</strong>\n"
"                    ນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບການວາງແຜນ (Planning)</strong> ເພື່ອສ້າງ ແລະ "
"ຈັດການຕາຕະລາງເວລາເຮັດວຽກຂອງພະນັກງານ,\n"
"                    ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີພະນັກງານພຽງພໍໃນເວລາທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ສຳລັບມື້ທີ່ມີລູກຄ້າຫຼາຍ ແລະ ສ"
"ຳລັບອໍເດີພິເສດ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>External Providers:</strong>\n"
"                            Check if a predefined Odoo connection exists if "
"you work with\n"
"                            specific shipping carriers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການພາຍນອກ:</strong>\n"
"                            ກວດເບິ່ງວ່າມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງ Odoo ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່ ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານເຮັ"
"ດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ\n"
"                            ບໍລິສັດຂົນສົ່ງສະເພາະ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>In-Store Pickup (Click &amp; Collect):</strong>\n"
"                            If you wish to offer this, you must\n"
"                            <strong>activate the setting</strong> within "
"the\n"
"                            <strong>Website Settings</strong> first."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຮັບຢູ່ໜ້າຮ້ານ (Click &amp; Collect):</strong>\n"
"                            ຖ້າຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ມີບໍລິການນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງ\n"
"                            <strong>ເປີດໃຊ້ງານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</strong> ຢູ່ໃນ\n"
"                            <strong>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເວັບໄຊ</strong> ກ່ອນ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Layout Settings:</strong>\n"
"                    Adjust the visual presentation and layout of products "
"using the\n"
"                    <strong>website editor</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບແບບການຈັດວາງ:</strong>\n"
"                    ປັບປ່ຽນການສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ການຈັດວາງສິນຄ້າໂດຍການນຳໃຊ້\n"
"                    <strong>ເຄື່ອງມືແກ້ໄຂເວັບໄຊ</strong>."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Loyalty Programs:</strong>\n"
"                            Implement <strong>loyalty cards</strong> as a "
"core strategy to <strong>activate customer retentio\n"
"                            </strong> and increase customer lifetime value."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂຄງການສະມາຊິກ:</strong>\n"
"                            ນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ບັດສະມາຊິກ</strong> ເປັນກົນລະຍຸດຫຼັກເພື່ອ "
"<strong>ຮັກສາຖານລູກຄ້າເກົ່າ\n"
"                            </strong> ແລະ ເພີ່ມມູນຄ່າຕະຫຼອດຊີວິດຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> Increased capability leads to higher complexity and "
"more maintenance."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໝາຍເຫດ:</strong> ຄວາມສາມາດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຈະມານຳຄວາມຊັບຊ້ອນ ແລະ ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາທີ່ຫຼາຍຂຶ້"
"ນ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Our Advice:</strong> Stick with your current streamlined "
"configuration until\n"
"                        you're fully comfortable. When you're ready to "
"upgrade, try the inventory module on a duplicated database first to ensure "
"it fits\n"
"                        your workflow. 😉"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄຳແນະນຳຂອງພວກເຮົາ:</strong> ຄວນໃຊ້ການກຳນົດຄ່າແບບລຽບງ່າຍໃນປະຈຸບັນໄປກ່ອນຈົນກວ່າ\n"
"                        ທ່ານຈະຄຸ້ນເຄີຍດີ. ເມື່ອທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ໂມດູນສາງສິນຄ້າໃນ"
"ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຈຳລອງກ່ອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າມັນເໝາະສົມກັບ\n"
"                        ຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ. 😉"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Payment Providers &amp; Methods:</strong>\n"
"                    Go to <strong>Website &gt; Configuration &gt; Payment "
"Providers</strong>\n"
"                    and install all the payment methods and providers you "
"plan to offer\n"
"                    (e.g., credit card processors, PayPal, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ວິທີການຊຳລະເງິນ:</strong>\n"
"                    ໄປທີ່ <strong>ເວັບໄຊ &gt; ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ &gt; ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊຳລະເງິນ</"
"strong>\n"
"                    ແລ້ວຕິດຕັ້ງວິທີການ ແລະ ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊຳລະເງິນທັງໝົດທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ບໍລິການ\n"
"                    (ເຊັ່ນ: ລະບົບຕັດບັດເຄຣດິດ, PayPal, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ)."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Payroll:</strong>\n"
"                    Use this feature to handle <strong>employee salaries and "
"manage holiday\n"
"                    requests.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເງິນເດືອນ:</strong>\n"
"                    ນຳໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເພື່ອຈັດການ <strong>ເງິນເດືອນພະນັກງານ ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍລາພັກ"
"ຕ່າງໆ.</strong>"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Point of Sale Category:</strong> For organizing transactions within "
"your shop system."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໝວດໝູ່ຈຸດຂາຍ (POS):</strong> ສຳລັບການຈັດໝວດໝູ່ລາຍການຂາຍພາຍໃນລະບົບຮ້ານຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Pricelist Segmentation:</strong>\n"
"                            Define multiple pricing structures for the same "
"product, supporting different\n"
"                            business models (e.g., B2B vs. B2C) and enabling "
"<strong>client-specific pricing\n"
"                            contracts.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການແບ່ງກຸ່ມລາຍການລາຄາ:</strong>\n"
"                            ກຳນົດໂຄງສ້າງລາຄາຫຼາຍຮູບແບບສຳລັບສິນຄ້າດຽວກັນ, ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບທຸລ"
"ະກິດ\n"
"                            ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ (ເຊັ່ນ: B2B ທຽບກັບ B2C) ແລະ ຮອງຮັບ <strong>"
"ສັນຍາລາຄາສະເພາະສຳລັບລູກຄ້າແຕ່ລະລາຍ.</strong>"

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Product Category:</strong> For internal tracking and reporting."
msgstr "<strong>ໝວດໝູ່ສິນຄ້າ:</strong> ສຳລັບການຕິດຕາມພາຍໃນ ແລະ ການເຮັດລາຍງານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Product-Level Settings:</strong>\n"
"                    Define core product settings directly on the "
"<strong>product form</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນລະດັບສິນຄ້າ:</strong>\n"
"                    ກຳນົດການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກຂອງສິນຄ້າໂດຍກົງຢູ່ທີ່ <strong>ຟອມສິນຄ້າ</strong>."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Promotional Agility:</strong>\n"
"                            Use <strong>discounts and promotions</strong> to "
"quickly adjust pricing for sales events or to give\n"
"                            targeted, <strong>manual reductions</strong> at "
"the point of sale."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນໃນການສົ່ງເສີມການຂາຍ:</strong>\n"
"                            ນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ສ່ວນຫຼຸດ ແລະ ໂປຣໂມຊັ່ນ</strong> ເພື່ອປັບລາຄາ"
"ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວສຳລັບກິດຈະກຳການຂາຍ ຫຼື ເພື່ອໃຫ້\n"
"                            <strong>ສ່ວນຫຼຸດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ</strong> ຢູ່ຈຸດຂາຍໜ້າຮ້ານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Publishing:</strong>\n"
"                    Each product can be <strong>published independently</"
"strong> on your online store."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການເຜີຍແຜ່:</strong>\n"
"                    ສິນຄ້າແຕ່ລະລາຍການສາມາດ <strong>ເຜີຍແຜ່ແຍກກັນໄດ້ຢ່າງເປັນອິດສະຫຼະ</"
"strong> ໃນຮ້ານຄ້າອອນລາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Quote and Confirm:</strong>\n"
"                    If a specific demand requires pricing, generate a "
"quotation directly from the\n"
"                    <strong>Sales</strong> app. The client can then confirm "
"and sign it online."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສະເໜີລາຄາ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນ:</strong>\n"
"                    ຖ້າມີຄວາມຕ້ອງການສະເພາະທີ່ຕ້ອງກຳນົດລາຄາ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໄດ້ໂ"
"ດຍກົງຈາກ\n"
"                    ແອັບ <strong>ການຂາຍ</strong>. ຈາກນັ້ນລູກຄ້າສາມາດຢືນຢັນ ແລະ ເຊັນຊື່ອ"
"ອນລາຍໄດ້."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Restaurant Mode:</strong>\n"
"                    Manage tables, orders, and payments with the Point of "
"Sale system if you offer an \"eat-in\" option."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂໝດຮ້ານອາຫານ:</strong>\n"
"                    ຈັດການໂຕະ, ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ ແລະ ການຊຳລະເງິນດ້ວຍລະບົບຈຸດຂາຍ (POS) ຖ້າຫາ"
"ກທ່ານມີບໍລິການ \"ນັ່ງກິນຢູ່ຮ້ານ\"."

#. module: bakery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bakery.welcome_article_body
